### When (Pattern Matching)

```redblue
when value
    case 1 then say "one"
    case 2 then say "two"
    else say "other"
end
```

### Unless

```redblue
unless is_valid
    say "Invalid!"
end
quietly runs zero times.

### Repeat Loop

```redblue
repeat 10 times
    say "Hello"
end
```

### While Loop

```redblue
while x > 0
    set x to x - 1
end
```

### Repeat Until

```redblue
repeat
    set x to x + 1
until x > 10
